  "titulo": "Aquel, aquella, aquellos, aquellas: that one over there",
  "subtitulo": "¿Esa casa? No, aquella.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "For that one / those (ones) far from both speakers, or far back in time, use aquel, aquella, aquellos, aquellas, matching the noun. Aquello (neutral, no plural) is for an idea or a thing you can't name.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Spanish has three distances: **este** (here, near me), **ese** (there, near you) and **aquel** (over there, far from both of us)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Masculine",
            "Feminine",
            "Neutral"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "Singular",
              "**aquel**",
              "**aquella**",
              "**aquello**"
            ],
            [
              "Plural",
              "**aquellos**",
              "**aquellas**",
              "—"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Careful: the masculine singular is **aquel**, ending in -l. **Aquello** is only the neutral form."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Match the gender and number of the thing: la casa → **aquella**; los cerros → **aquellos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It also points far back in time: ¿Te acuerdas de **aquello**? (_that thing back then_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It often goes with **allá**: **aquel de allá**, **aquellas de allá**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **aquel** is the long arm: it reaches over there, past you and me."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Ese barco no, ==aquel== de allá.",
              "en": "Not that boat, that one over there."
            },
