              "es": "¿Cuáles cerros? ==Aquellos==, los de allá.",
              "en": "Which hills? Those, the ones over there."
            },
            {
              "es": "De todas las casas de la calle, la mía es ==aquella== del fondo.",
              "en": "Of all the houses on the street, mine is that one at the end."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis tenis no son esos; son ==aquellos==.",
              "en": "My sneakers aren't those; they're those over there."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Te acuerdas de ==aquello== que pasó en la fiesta?",
